From: ggbdpq <ggbdpq@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 08:49:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] provider, catalog: a remote magpie whose catalog a slow link
 cut is told so, and added by its plain list (#5457)

---
 internal/catalog/live.go                      |  13 ++-
 internal/catalog/live_incomplete_test.go      |  65 +++++++++++
 internal/provider/models.go                   |  26 +++++
 internal/provider/provider.go                 |   8 ++
 internal/provider/remote_magpie.go            |   6 ++
 .../provider/remote_magpie_slowlist_test.go   | 102 ++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 219 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 internal/catalog/live_incomplete_test.go
